  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/652/652-16-e.htm",
  "statuteText": "652:16-e Business Session. –\n\n\"Business session\" means, in a town that has not adopted the provisions of RSA 40:13, the session of a town meeting at which voters discuss, deliberate, and vote on matters other than the election of officers by official ballot and other questions that are placed on the official ballot."
}
